module jev_generation_trace_observation

input source_version
input contract_version
input contract_name
input contract_digest
input ir_digest
input generated_artifact_digest
input reverse_observation_digest
input metric_digest
input evidence_prefix_digest
input producer_deferred

status BOUND declaration, IR, generation, reverse observation, and metric evidence are linked
status DEFERRED generation trace producer is deferred
status UNKNOWN missing identity, stage, or digest

field missing_stage
field target_stage
field reason
field trace_signal
field observation_digest

constraint observation_only
constraint no_improvement_claim
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command